{"meta":{"id":"tt32250381","type":"movie","name":"Million Dollar Madness","imdb_id":"tt32250381","description":"Under immense pressure and amidst competition with a duplicitous colleague, Stan, the ambitious and very serious operations manager of a construction firm reaches breaking point when he learns that he’s been unfairly laid off by the company’s tyrannical CEO. He impulsively steals one million euros from the company’s vault, tosses away the key to the safe and hastily flees with his fiancée Marine… Before discovering that his termination was a mistake, and he is actually being promoted! Stan has until sunrise to return the money to the vault. But having thrown away his key, and with the only spare inside the CEO’s own apartment, he must reluctantly enlist the help of Hippolyte, Paris’s most unpredictable locksmith. The night promises to be full of twists and turns!","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt32250381.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hJZi4BNyejM0BtBlWsMhGx7dUoq.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qPNBeFgI6euFSocCq5SofYD0Pej.png","genres":["Comedia","Crimen"],"releaseInfo":"2025","released":"2025-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"90 min","imdbRating":"5.2","country":"France","cast":["Christian Clavier","Rayane Bensetti","Julie Ferrier","Claire Chust","Charlotte Gabris","Martin Verset","Gilles Cohen","Jean-Luc Couchard","Léonard Berthet-Rivière","Cédric Moreau","Maria Verdi"],"director":["Grégoire Vigneron"],"writer":["Julie Ponsonnet","Grégoire Vigneron","Isabelle Jacquet"],"trailers":[{"source":"R_3-zFCs39c","type":"Trailer","name":"Atrapa el millón - Tráiler español","ytId":"R_3-zFCs39c","lang":"es"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"R_3-zFCs39c","title":"Atrapa el millón - Tráiler español"}],"links":[{"name":"5.2","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt32250381"},{"name":"Comedia","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3